# 04 — Design Diagrams (Mermaid)

## Диаграмма состояний игры (XState)

```mermaid
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> loading
    loading --> hub : DATA_LOADED
    loading --> error : LOAD_ERROR
    
    error --> loading : RETRY
    
    hub --> exploring : TELEPORT_TO_BUILDING
    hub --> usingAbility : ACTIVATE_ABILITY
    hub --> dialogue : OPEN_DIALOGUE
    
    exploring --> inScenario : ENTER_BUILDING
    exploring --> hub : RETURN_TO_HUB
    exploring --> usingAbility : ACTIVATE_ABILITY
    
    usingAbility --> hub : DEACTIVATE_ABILITY
    usingAbility --> hub : timeout(10s)
    
    inScenario --> hub : COMPLETE_SCENARIO
    inScenario --> hub : EXIT_SCENARIO
    inScenario --> inScenario : COMPLETE_STEP
    
    dialogue --> hub : CLOSE_DIALOGUE
    dialogue --> dialogue : SELECT_CHOICE
```

## Диаграмма способностей

```mermaid
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Idle
    
    Idle --> Activating : hotkey/click
    Activating --> Active : effect_created
    Active --> Active : animate(delta)
    Active --> Cooldown : duration_expired
    Cooldown --> Idle : cooldown_expired
    
    note right of Active
        Визуальный эффект
        отображается в 3D-сцене
    end note
    
    note right of Cooldown
        Кнопка затемнена
        таймер обратного отсчёта
    end note
```

## Диаграмма загрузки данных

```mermaid
flowchart TD
    A[Start] --> B[Load resume.json]
    B --> C{Valid JSON?}
    C -->|No| D[Show Error]
    C -->|Yes| E[Validate Schema]
    E --> F{Valid Schema?}
    F -->|No| D
    F -->|Yes| G[Generate World]
    G --> H[Create Buildings from work[]]
    H --> I[Create Abilities from abilities[]]
    I --> J[Setup Skills from skills[]]
    J --> K[Load Dialogues]
    K --> L[Ready - Hub State]
```

## Диаграмма взаимодействия игрока

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant P as Player
    participant UI as HUD
    participant SM as SceneManager
    participant WG as WorldGenerator
    participant AS as AbilitySystem
    
    P->>UI: Click on building
    UI->>SM: Raycast
    SM-->>UI: Hit result
    UI->>UI: Show building info panel
    P->>UI: "Start scenario"
    UI->>UI: Show scenario steps
    P->>UI: Press hotkey (1-7)
    UI->>AS: activate(abilityId)
    AS->>SM: Create 3D effect
    AS-->>UI: Success + cooldown
    P->>UI: Complete step
    UI->>UI: Update progress
    P->>UI: Complete scenario
    UI->>UI: Show metrics
```

## Архитектурная диаграмма

```mermaid
graph TD
    subgraph Data Layer
        RJ[resume.json]
        DJ[dialogues.json]
        RS[resume_schema.json]
    end
    
    subgraph Engine Layer
        SM[SceneManager]
        WG[WorldGenerator]
        PC[PlayerController]
        AS[AbilitySystem]
    end
    
    subgraph State Layer
        GM[GameMachine - XState]
    end
    
    subgraph UI Layer
        HUD[HUD Component]
        INV[Inventory]
        MAP[Minimap]
        SCN[ScenarioPanel]
    end
    
    RJ --> WG
    RJ --> AS
    RJ --> HUD
    DJ --> HUD
    RS --> RJ
    
    SM --> WG
    SM --> PC
    SM --> AS
    
    GM --> HUD
    HUD --> AS
    HUD --> PC
    
    WG --> SM
    AS --> SM
```
